msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefRelicWeapon030GetReplica_00171:TEXT_CMNDEFRELICWEAPON030GETREPLICA_00171_HUBAIRTIN_000_020:1"
msgid "Creating <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> requires <if ($n2 == 1)>one bottle<else><if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> bottles</if> of superior enchanted ink."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と<br>ハイエンチャントインク×<num $n2>を交換しますか？
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></capitalize> für <num $n2> Fässchen Starkzauber-Tinte anfertigen lassen?
#. fr: Donner <num $n2> <if ($n2 <= 1)>bouteille d'encre de haute qualité<else>bouteilles d'encre de haute qualité</if> pour obtenir <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)>one bottle<else><if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<ca… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
